notes=('Office suite: 51 old names reduced to six market archetypes (Microsoft Office with version years from the fetched history page; iWork; Google Workspace; LibreOffice; WPS Office; OnlyOffice) plus eight flat entries. Dropped dead or trade/research: Andrew User Interface System, Simdesk, Zimbra, Tiki Wiki CMS, Feng Office, Lotus Symphony/SmartSuite/Jazz, IBM Works, Microsoft Works, Applixware, AppleWorks, Gobe Productive, Interleaf, Siag Office, StarOffice, ThinkFree, AndrOpen/Jambo/MobiOffice, EasyOffice, OpenDesk, Picsel, Polaris, QuickOffice, NeoOffice, Lark, Ichitaro-only suite entries, GNU TeXmacs. '
 'Word processor 39 to 12, spreadsheet 24 to 10, presentation 24 to 11 (dropped Brainshark, Mentimeter, Wooclap, CA-Cricket Presents, IBM Storyboard Plus, Sway, NCH ExpressPoints, Beamer, PowerPoint Online as duplicate), PDF editor 80 to 12 plus an Acrobat archetype (dropped trade/duplicate: Bluebeam Revu, ReadSoft-like tools, eCopy, gDoc Fusion, printers and old viewers), OCR 16 to 10 (dropped AnyDoc, Google Cloud Vision, ReadSoft, AIDA, Microsoft Office Document Imaging as trade or dead). Exact Office edition names beyond Home & Student, Home & Business, Personal and Family were not on retrieved pages, so omitted.')
